WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:04.180
Here’s what happened when the Foundation
put five pounds of raw ground beef into the

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:05.180
Clockworks!

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:08.360
On Rough, a pound of ground beef became a
pound of beef slurry.

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:12.179
On Fine, a pound of ground beef became one
medium-rare round steak.

00:00:12.179 --> 00:00:16.960
On another Fine test, a pound of ground beef
became a pound of beef jerky of equal weight.

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:21.240
On the first Very Fine test, a pound of ground
beef became a pair of delicious half-pound

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:24.720
flank steaks, well-done and lightly drizzled
with gravy.

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:28.880
On the second Very Fine test, it became a
nightmarish creature that the Foundation was

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:31.890
thankfully able to terminate before it killed
anybody.

